== (a) conductor statistics of the row family (eta trivial, Q0 = (72)) ==
   q6(z) = prod of N(P) over primes P not above 2,3 with v_P(z) != 0 mod 6  ( ~ conductor norm of (z/.)_6 away from 2, lambda )
   rows with q6 = 1 are exactly the rows REMOVED by initialKeep (their primitive character has conductor | 72).
